## Interface: 16001
## Title: GaarQuestsForever
## Notes: Orders the Quests section of Forever's objective tracker by level or distance, watches the lowest quests that fit the tracker's height (auto-watch), optionally only the current dungeon's quests, and shows at most N. auto-accepts quests if asked. /gqf or the minimap button
